I never understood that idea.  If I were a serial killer I wouldn't want any
press.

And there is at least 1 good reason for lojban being an auxlang (at least at
some point in the future after it's been completed).  One of the design
goals was cultural neutrality.  Not many conlangs and certainly no natlangs
have been designed with that in mind I think.

